They're also quite noticeable in tiles, rather than ASCII. Given that
they can always be seen via farlook, I decided to move them into the 'W'
monster class in AceHack and NetHack 4 (which have a policy of not
trying to mislead the players via the interface).

Making them not show up on telepathy is an interesting idea, though, and
may help to stay closer to the spirit of the original.

